msgstr "Smanjuje kontrast slike"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:775
msgid "The 'Decrease Contrast' command decreases the video contrast."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Smanji kontrast</interface> smanjuje kontrast slike."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:780
msgid "Increase &Contrast"
msgstr "Povećaj &kontrast"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:782
msgid "Increases video contrast"
msgstr "Povećava kontrast slike"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:783
msgid "The 'Increase Contrast' command increases the video contrast."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Povećaj kontrast</interface> povećava kontrast slike."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:788
msgid "Decrease B&rightness"
msgstr "Smanji o&svetljaj"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:790
msgid "Decreases video brightness"
msgstr "Smanjuje osvetljaj slike"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:791
msgid "The 'Decrease Brightness' command decreases the video brightness."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Smanji osvetljaj</interface> smanjuje osvetljaj slike."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:796
msgid "Increase &Brightness"
msgstr "Povećaj &osvetljaj"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:798
msgid "Increases video brightness"
msgstr "Povećava osvetljaj slike"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:799
msgid "The 'Increase Brightness' command increases the video brightness."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Povećaj osvetljaj</interface> povećava osvetljaj slike."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:804
msgid "Decrease H&ue"
msgstr "Smanji &boju"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:806
msgid "Decreases video hue"
msgstr "Smanjuje obojenost slike"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:807
msgid "The 'Decrease Hue' command decreases the video hue."
msgstr "Naredba <interface>Smanji boju</interface> smanjuje obojenost slike."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:812
msgid "Increase &Hue"
msgstr "Povećaj b&oju"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:814
msgid "Increases video hue"
msgstr "Povećava obojenost slike"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:815
msgid "The 'Increase Hue' command increases the video hue."
msgstr "Naredba <interface>Povećaj boju</interface> povećava obojenost slike."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:820
msgid "Decrease S&aturation"
msgstr "Smanji z&asićenje"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:822
msgid "Decreases video saturation"
msgstr "Smanjuje zasićenje slike"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:823
msgid "The 'Decrease Saturation' command decreases the video saturation."
msgstr "Naredba <interface>Smanji boju</interface> smanjuje zasićenje slike."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:828
msgid "Increase &Saturation"
msgstr "Povećaj za&sićenje"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:830
msgid "Increases video saturation"
msgstr "Povećava zasićenje slike"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:831
msgid "The 'Increase Saturation' command increases the video saturation."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Povećaj zasićenje</interface> povećava zasićenje slike."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:837
msgid "Changes contrast level"
msgstr "Mijenja nivo kontrasta"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:838
msgid ""
"The Contrast slider shows the current video contrast level and allows you to "
"change it."
msgstr ""
"Klizač za kontrast prikazuje trenutni kontrast slike i omogućava da ga "
"mijenjate."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:844
msgid "Changes brightness level"
msgstr "Mijenja nivo osvetljaja"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:845
msgid ""
"The Brightness slider shows the current video brightness level and allows "
"you to change it."
msgstr ""
"Klizač za osvetljaj prikazuje trenutni osvetljaj slike i omogućava da ga "
"mijenjate."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:851
msgid "Changes hue level"
msgstr "Mijenja nivo boje"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:852
msgid ""
"The Hue slider shows the current video hue level and allows you to change it."
msgstr ""
"Klizač za boju prikazuje trenutnu obojenost slike i omogućava da je "
"mijenjate."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:858
msgid "Changes saturation level"
msgstr "Mijenja nivo zasićenja"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:859
msgid ""
"The Saturation slider shows the current video saturation level and allows "
"you to change it."
msgstr ""
"Klizač za zasićenje prikazuje trenutno zasićenje slike i omogućava da ga "
"mijenjate."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:867
msgid "Shows the contrast popup slider"
msgstr "Prikazuje klizač za kontrast"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:868
msgid ""
"The Contrast button displays a slider that shows the current video contrast "
"level and allows you to change it."
msgstr ""
"Dugme za kontrast prikazuje klizač koji pokazuje trenutni kontrast slike i "
"omogućava da ga mijenjate."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:876
msgid "Shows the brightness popup slider"
msgstr "Prikazuje klizač za osvetljaj"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:877
msgid ""
"The Brightness button displays a slider that shows the current video "
"brightness level and allows you to change it."
msgstr ""
"Dugme za osvetljaj prikazuje klizač koji pokazuje trenutni osvetljaj slike i "
"omogućava da ga mijenjate."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:885
msgid "Shows the hue popup slider"
msgstr "Prikazuje klizač za boju"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:886
msgid ""
"The Hue button displays a slider that shows the current video hue level and "
"allows you to change it."
msgstr ""
"Dugme za boju prikazuje klizač koji pokazuje trenutnu obojenost slike i "
"omogućava da je mijenjate."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:894
msgid "Shows the saturation popup slider"
msgstr "Prikazuje klizač za zasićenje"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:895
msgid ""
"The Saturation button displays a slider that shows the current video "
"saturation level and allows you to change it."
msgstr ""
"Dugme za zasićenje prikazuje klizač koji pokazuje trenutno zasićenje slike i "
"omogućava da ga mijenjate."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:903
msgid "S&oft Frame Dropping"
msgstr "S&labo ispuštanje kadrova"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:904
msgid "Turns soft frame dropping on/off"
msgstr "Uključuje/isključuje slabo ispuštanje kadrova"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:905
msgid ""
"The 'Soft Frame Dropping' command toggles the soft frame dropping option. If "
"your system is too slow to play a file, MPlayer can drop some frames so "
"playback does not slow down. The soft option drops frames less aggressively "
"than the hard one, and should not cause playback problems. The Frame drop "
"option can also be set on the Advanced page either globally in KPlayer "
"Settings or for a particular file in the File Properties."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Slabo ispuštanje kadrova</interface> uključuje ili "
"isključuje opciju za slabo ispuštanje kadrova. Ako je vaš sistem previše "
"spor za puštanje datoteke, M‑plejer može ispustiti poneki kadar da puštanje "
"ne bi bilo previše sporo. Slabo ispuštanje kadrova je manje agresivno od "
"jakog i ne bi trebalo da izazove probleme pri puštanju. Opcija ispuštanja "
"kadrova se takođe može podesiti na stranici <interface>Napredno</interface> "
"u postavkama K‑plejera globalno, ili za određenu datoteku u svojstvima "
"datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:910
msgid "&Hard Frame Dropping"
msgstr "&Jako ispuštanje kadrova"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:911
msgid "Turns hard frame dropping on/off"
msgstr "Uključuje/isključuje jako ispuštanje kadrova"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:912
msgid ""
"The 'Hard Frame Dropping' command toggles the hard frame dropping option. If "
"your system is too slow to play a file, MPlayer can drop some frames so "
"playback does not slow down. The hard option drops frames more aggressively "
"than the soft one, and may sometimes break decoding. The Frame drop option "
"can also be set on the Advanced page either globally in KPlayer Settings or "
"for a particular file in the File Properties."
msgstr ""
"Naredba <interface>Jako ispuštanje kadrova</interface> uključuje ili "
"isključuje opciju za jako ispuštanje kadrova. Ako je vaš sistem previše spor "
"za puštanje datoteke, M‑plejer može ispustiti poneki kadar da puštanje ne bi "
"bilo previše sporo. Jako ispuštanje kadrova je agresivnije od slabog i može "
"da izazove prekid u dekodiranju. Opcija ispuštanja kadrova se takođe može "
"podesiti na stranici Napredno u postavkama K‑plejera globalno, ili za "
"određeni datoteku u svojstvima datoteke."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:917 kplayernodeview.cpp:3382
msgid "Move &Down"
msgstr "Pomjeri &dole"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:919
msgid "Moves subtitles down"
